*1 [[Puffsley's Comet]] spawns after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>.
*3 [[Miz Devil]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 10~13.33 seconds<sup>300f~400f</sup>.
*2 [[Ackey]]s spawn after 53.33 seconds<sup>1,600f</sup>, delay 166.67~170 seconds<sup>5,000f~5,100f</sup>.
*1 [[Miz Devil]] spawns after 60 seconds<sup>1,800f</sup>.
*3 [[Condemned Peng]]s spawn after 106.67 seconds<sup>3,200f</sup>, delay 66.67~70 seconds<sup>2,000f~2,100f</sup>.
